---
---

<section class="dr-news">
  <div class="dr-wrap dr-news__grid">
    <div>
      <h2>Suscribirme al Newsletter</h2>
      <p>Mantente informado de todas las novedades odontológicas para cuidar tu salud dental de la mejor manera.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="dr-news__form" onsubmit="return false">
      <div class="dr-news__campo">
        <input type="email" placeholder="Ingresa tu email" required />
        <button type="submit">Suscribirme</button>
      </div>
      <p class="dr-news__legal">Al suscribirte aceptas nuestra <a href="#top">Política de Privacidad</a></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dr-news {
    background: var(--dr-azul);
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .dr-news__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .dr-news__grid h2 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .dr-news__grid > div > p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .dr-news__campo {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .dr-news__campo input {
    flex: 1;
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--dr-pill);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.3rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .dr-news__campo input:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #fff;
  }

  .dr-news__campo button {
    background: var(--dr-navy-oscuro);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--dr-pill);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .dr-news__campo button:hover {
    background: var(--dr-tinta);
  }

  .dr-news__legal {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .dr-news__legal a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .dr-news__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .dr-news__campo {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
